{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48816","headline":"曲龙山歌 二 · 顾况","name":"曲龙山歌 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"子欲居九夷，乘桴浮於海，圣人之意有所在。\n曲龙何在在海中，石室玉堂窅玲珑。\n其下琛怪之所产，其上灵栖复无限。\n无风浪顶高屋脊，有风天晴翻海眼。\n愿逐刚风骑吏旋，起居按摩参寥天。\n凤皇颊骨流珠佩，孔雀尾毛张翠盖。\n下看人界等虫沙，夜宿层城阿母家。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾况","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48816.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48816","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}